ion. High Sequence (4/5) - If your Sequence is 4 or 5 after the Shift, draw 1 card.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-014","name":"Borrowed Beat","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - Choose a friendly creature that has already acted this round. Ready it; it may take one additional combat action this round.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-015","name":"Cut Ahead","type":"Spell","cost":1,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Shift your Sequence 1 step in its current direction. Sequence Complete - Gain 2 resources this round.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-016","name":"Rewind the Line","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Move your Sequence 1 step toward 0. High Sequence (4/5) - If you were at 4 or 5 before or after this move, draw 1 card.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-017","name":"Perfect Interval","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - Choose a friendly creature. Its printed High Sequence effect remains active until the start of your next round even if your Sequence leaves 4/5.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-018","name":"Long Way Around","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Sequence Complete - Draw 1 card. Your next two cards this round each cost 1 less, minimum 1.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-019","name":"Out of Order","type":"Trap","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"When an enemy creature attacks, High Sequence (4/5) - That attacker gets -3 STR for this combat. If you are not at High Sequence, this Trap remains set.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-020","name":"Last Before First","type":"Trap","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"When a friendly creature is destroyed, Shift your Sequence 1 step in its current direction. Sequence Complete - Draw 1 card.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-021","name":"Opening Echo","type":"Creature","cost":1,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/2","rules":"On play, Shift your Sequence 1 step in its current direction. Sequence Complete - If this play caused the completion, draw 1 card.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":2,"hp":2,"legendary":false},{"id":"CON-022","name":"Midpoint Warden","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/5","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - The first time each round a friendly creature would take damage, reduce that damage by 2.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":2,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"CON-023","name":"Triple Threader","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"3/4","rules":"Sequence Complete - Draw 2 cards, then put 1 card from your hand on the bottom of your deck.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":3,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"CON-024","name":"Loop Hound","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/4","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - Loop Hound has +2 STR / +2 maximum and current HP. Whenever your Sequence moves from 5 to 4, ready Loop Hound.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":5,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"CON-025","name":"Seventh Step","type":"Creature","cost":6,"resource":1,"statsText":"4/7","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - The first Spell you play each round costs 2 less, minimum 1.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":4,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"CON-026","name":"The Infinite Interval","type":"Legendary Creature","cost":9,"resource":2,"statsText":"7/9","rules":"High Sequence (4/5) - The Infinite Interval has +2 STR / +2 maximum and current HP. Sequence Complete - Draw 2 cards; your next card this round costs 2 less, minimum 1. SKIP AHEAD - Perfect Acceleration: you may use Skip Ahead twice per round; each use still requires its discard. If the second use causes Sequence Complete, draw 1 card. LOOP BACK - Closed Circuit: the first time each round your Sequence moves backward while at 4 or 5, all friendly creatures with a High Sequence effect gain +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP this round.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON","str":7,"hp":9,"legendary":true},{"id":"CON-027","name":"Count to Three","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Shift your Sequence 1 step in its current direction. High Sequence (4/5) - Your next three cards this round each cost 1 less, minimum 1.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-028","name":"Repeat Measure","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Sequence Complete - Copy one other Sequence Complete effect you control that triggered from this completion. You may choose new legal targets.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-029","name":"Beyond the Fifth","type":"Spell","cost":6,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Sequence Complete - Draw 2 cards. Your next card this round costs 3 less, minimum 1.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"},{"id":"CON-030","name":"Missed Beat","type":"Trap","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"When an enemy creature attacks, Shift your Sequence 1 step in its current direction. High Sequence (4/5) - If your Sequence is 4 or 5 after the Shift, that attacker gets -3 STR for this combat.","faction":"Continuum","code":"CON"}],"Moondemons":[{"id":"MON-001","name":"Bloodtrail Cub","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":1,"statsText":"2/3","rules":"Bloodied - Bloodtrail Cub has +2 STR while attacking.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":2,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-002","name":"Scar Dancer","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"3/4","rules":"Bloodied - After Scar Dancer deals damage and its universal 2-HP restore resolves, you may deal 1 damage to Scar Dancer.","faction":"Moondemons","code":"MON","str":3,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"MON-003","name":"Pale Leech","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/5","rules":"Bloodied - The first time each round Pale Leech restores HP from dealing damag